WEBVTT

01:38.160 --> 01:42.979
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.490 --> 01:45.800
[Episode 5]

01:51.840 --> 01:52.350
My Lord.

01:54.430 --> 01:55.920
These are the clothes
you asked me to buy

01:55.920 --> 01:56.850
for Fourth Lady.

01:58.000 --> 01:58.860
Send them over.

01:59.200 --> 02:00.400
Impressive, My Lord.

02:00.680 --> 02:04.340
You could tell Fourth Lady's measurements
just by looking at her.

02:08.520 --> 02:09.710
I misspoke.

02:10.080 --> 02:11.150
Please forgive me, My Lord.

02:11.150 --> 02:12.880
I'll send them over right away.

02:16.750 --> 02:17.310
My Lord.

02:17.870 --> 02:18.870
The Xie Residence

02:19.430 --> 02:21.690
sent this over in the middle of the night.

02:24.470 --> 02:25.079
Read it.

02:26.190 --> 02:27.590
"Respectfully addressed to Lord Yan.

02:27.590 --> 02:28.770
The chill of early spring
seeps through the curtains,

02:28.770 --> 02:30.150
and the night rain
shows no sign of letting up.

02:30.150 --> 02:32.240
Our Fourth Lady is still weak
from her recent injuries

02:32.240 --> 02:33.810
and may not be able to
make the journey home.

02:33.810 --> 02:36.250
We humbly ask that she be allowed to
spend the night at your residence

02:36.250 --> 02:37.650
to shelter from the cold.

02:37.680 --> 02:39.150
We hear that a newly blossomed plum branch

02:39.150 --> 02:41.079
has appeared in the courtyard there,

02:41.079 --> 02:42.360
its buds glistening with dew.

02:42.360 --> 02:43.590
It would be most fitting

02:43.590 --> 02:45.430
in the celadon vase by your bedside.

02:45.430 --> 02:49.290
We'd be grateful if Your Lordship could
look after her for the night."

02:50.590 --> 02:52.390
The Xie family sure is generous.

02:55.560 --> 02:56.470
Qinghe.

02:57.430 --> 03:00.560
You must copy these sutras carefully.

03:01.310 --> 03:04.240
I just don't understand
what Old Madam was thinking.

03:04.280 --> 03:06.120
Why would she betroth Qingyuan

03:06.960 --> 03:08.590
to Lord Yan?

03:12.030 --> 03:12.560
Mother.

03:13.240 --> 03:14.440
What did you just say?

03:23.560 --> 03:24.470
Did you just say

03:24.910 --> 03:26.240
that Qingyuan would be betrothed

03:26.240 --> 03:27.240
to Yan Rui?

03:33.190 --> 03:34.190
Stop right there.

03:37.400 --> 03:38.530
Where are you going?

03:39.190 --> 03:40.840
You haven't even finished
copying the sutras

03:40.840 --> 03:41.750
Old Madam asked you to copy yet.

03:41.750 --> 03:42.560
Mother!

03:42.560 --> 03:44.710
Fourth Sister is about to be thrown into
the lion's den!

03:44.710 --> 03:48.710
How much longer are you going to
pretend you don't see what's happening?

03:49.910 --> 03:51.440
If it weren't to protect me,

03:51.910 --> 03:54.000
she wouldn't have crossed
Second Sister and Third Sister,

03:54.000 --> 03:55.800
and she wouldn't have had to
take all the blame herself.

03:55.800 --> 03:57.600
-Then she wouldn't...
-Enough!

04:00.750 --> 04:02.010
More than a decade ago,

04:03.400 --> 04:06.030
when Fourth Madam
was driven out of the residence,

04:06.030 --> 04:07.830
I fought it every step of the way,

04:08.110 --> 04:09.510
just as you're doing now.

04:09.840 --> 04:10.900
And how did that go?

04:11.430 --> 04:12.430
Did it do any good?

04:12.910 --> 04:14.030
Did it change anything?

04:14.030 --> 04:16.829
So this time, there's no need to
even put up a fight,

04:17.360 --> 04:20.220
and we'll just let this be
the end for Fourth Sister?

04:28.680 --> 04:29.390
Qinghe!

04:31.600 --> 04:32.430
Qinghe!

04:33.830 --> 04:36.159
Old Madam personally sent someone
to deliver the betrothal letter.

04:36.159 --> 04:37.560
It's already a done deal!

05:03.680 --> 05:05.140
You look really beautiful

05:05.430 --> 05:06.430
in this outfit.

05:07.270 --> 05:08.030
Is that so?

05:08.830 --> 05:11.030
Which girl was this meant for, Lord Yan?

05:14.070 --> 05:14.870
Do you like it?

05:20.360 --> 05:21.760
No need for the medicine.

05:21.870 --> 05:23.000
Thank you, Lord Yan.

05:40.600 --> 05:41.240
Sit down.

05:53.159 --> 05:53.830
Let me see.

05:54.750 --> 05:56.070
What are you trying to do?

05:56.070 --> 05:58.800
I'd never take advantage of
someone in distress.

06:02.360 --> 06:04.190
Or is it because you think
this scar is unsightly

06:04.190 --> 06:05.920
and don't want anyone to see it?

06:43.560 --> 06:44.480
If it hurts,

06:45.120 --> 06:46.450
you can hold on tighter.

06:47.360 --> 06:48.430
I would't mind.

07:48.600 --> 07:49.260
Don't move.

07:57.800 --> 08:00.600
Did you have to go that far with
playing the victim?

08:01.750 --> 08:03.860
Thank goodness you didn't damage
any meridians.

08:03.860 --> 08:04.820
Otherwise,

08:05.230 --> 08:06.230
you could've lost

08:06.360 --> 08:07.960
the use of this hand for good.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.250
At least I won my bet.

08:14.190 --> 08:15.390
I'll be leaving then.

08:15.430 --> 08:16.830
Tomorrow, I'll have these clothes
washed and...

08:16.830 --> 08:17.830
Stop right there.

08:23.800 --> 08:24.680
Xie Qingyuan.

08:25.070 --> 08:28.070
So eager to settle accounts with me
and be done with it?

08:28.630 --> 08:30.390
Then tomorrow, I'll have Granny Chen

08:30.390 --> 08:31.480
send over some more osmanthus candy

08:31.480 --> 08:32.549
and medicinal dishes

08:32.549 --> 08:34.630
to make up for the cost of this garment.

08:34.630 --> 08:35.270
Alright.

08:36.030 --> 08:37.690
But you're not leaving today.

08:53.480 --> 08:54.360
Mother.

08:54.670 --> 08:56.910
Let's go plead with Old Madam, okay?

08:57.360 --> 08:58.200
Please!

08:58.480 --> 09:00.790
She's a daughter of the Xie family,
after all!

09:00.790 --> 09:02.000
I'm begging you!

09:02.270 --> 09:03.600
It's precisely because

09:04.270 --> 09:06.530
you're daughters of the Xie family that,

09:06.840 --> 09:08.200
in Grandmother's eyes,

09:09.120 --> 09:11.840
you must make sacrifices
for the Xie family.

09:12.750 --> 09:14.200
This is Qingyuan's fate,

09:15.630 --> 09:17.090
just as it was her mother's

09:18.030 --> 09:19.440
all those years ago.

09:22.360 --> 09:24.120
This is Fourth Madam's fate,

09:25.030 --> 09:26.630
Qingyuan's fate,

09:28.080 --> 09:30.340
and even more so,
the fate of the two of us.

09:32.270 --> 09:33.030
Is there...

09:34.030 --> 09:36.120
Is there really no other way

09:36.120 --> 09:37.910
to save Fourth Sister?

09:37.910 --> 09:38.840
No!

09:38.960 --> 09:41.890
Because we're in no position
to protect anyone else!

09:41.910 --> 09:43.440
I have no authority over the household,

09:43.440 --> 09:45.480
and you have no powerful husband
to stand behind you.

09:45.480 --> 09:47.610
How are we supposed to protect anyone?

09:47.960 --> 09:48.960
I know

09:49.600 --> 09:50.930
I've let Qingyuan down.

09:51.440 --> 09:52.750
But what can I do?

09:59.080 --> 09:59.540
Mother.

09:59.670 --> 10:00.130
Mother,

10:00.320 --> 10:01.000
get up.

10:01.840 --> 10:02.440
Qinghe.

10:03.000 --> 10:04.790
If you feel guilty toward Qingyuan,

10:04.790 --> 10:06.270
then once she comes back
from the Yan Residence,

10:06.270 --> 10:07.540
let's treat her well.

10:07.840 --> 10:08.550
All right?

10:09.870 --> 10:10.670
All right.

10:15.120 --> 10:15.980
Come on, get up.

10:17.720 --> 10:18.390
Qinghe.

10:20.270 --> 10:21.120
I know

10:22.120 --> 10:23.000
you're upset

10:23.150 --> 10:24.440
that Qingru threw away

10:25.240 --> 10:26.640
your introductory gift,

10:27.840 --> 10:29.480
but listen to me.

10:29.340 --> 10:32.530
[Hanxiang Parlor]

10:29.910 --> 10:32.240
You mustn't force your way into anything.

10:32.470 --> 10:33.550
The Spring Banquet

10:33.720 --> 10:35.440
is actually being held
by the Founding Countess

10:35.440 --> 10:37.360
to choose a bride for her heir.

10:37.670 --> 10:39.120
At a time like this,

10:39.480 --> 10:41.540
you mustn't stir up any more trouble.

10:42.670 --> 10:43.670
As for

10:44.360 --> 10:46.870
Qingrong and Young Master Pei,

10:48.000 --> 10:49.320
their marriage

10:49.840 --> 10:51.360
is already set in stone.

10:51.840 --> 10:52.630
We

10:53.440 --> 10:56.040
mustn't entertain
any improper hopes either.

10:58.720 --> 10:59.780
Do you understand?

11:02.790 --> 11:04.270
Fourth Madam

11:04.790 --> 11:06.390
used to teach me how to write.

11:06.390 --> 11:07.440
She said

11:07.910 --> 11:10.720
as long as I copy the sutras 108 times,

11:12.630 --> 11:14.630
it would ward off misfortune for me.

11:23.150 --> 11:24.510
But in this household,

11:26.720 --> 11:28.850
where would we find a Buddha to save us?

11:49.290 --> 11:49.900
Take it slow!

11:49.900 --> 11:50.960
It's flying.

11:53.680 --> 11:54.290
Hurry up.

11:54.310 --> 11:55.160
Coming.

11:55.360 --> 11:56.750
Spring is in full bloom

11:56.870 --> 11:57.960
by Hongyao Bridge.

11:58.390 --> 11:59.870
One branch split in two,

12:00.120 --> 12:01.380
yet sharing one heart.

12:01.790 --> 12:03.320
On the Shangsi Festival,

12:03.750 --> 12:05.550
orchids are worn as adornments,

12:06.000 --> 12:08.200
and peonies are offered
as tokens of affection—

12:08.200 --> 12:09.460
such elegant customs.

12:10.240 --> 12:11.510
Madam Hu, your poem

12:11.790 --> 12:13.450
fits the occasion perfectly.

12:14.360 --> 12:16.720
[Madam Pei]

12:14.720 --> 12:15.870
Our Lanshan is also at an age

12:15.870 --> 12:18.670
when we should start
thinking about his marriage.

12:18.670 --> 12:20.000
I thought this festival

12:20.030 --> 12:21.200
would be the perfect opportunity

12:21.200 --> 12:22.800
to find him a suitable match.

12:23.080 --> 12:24.600
Excellent.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.600
Although our Third Lady

12:28.270 --> 12:29.960
lost her mother at a young age,

12:30.550 --> 12:32.750
she's always been raised under my name.

12:32.750 --> 12:34.390
She's well-educated and well-mannered,

12:34.390 --> 12:37.050
and I'm sure she'll be
just what you have in mind.

12:37.080 --> 12:37.750
Good.

12:43.150 --> 12:44.010
Second Sister,

12:44.510 --> 12:45.640
does this look good?

12:46.840 --> 12:48.170
It's woven pretty well.

12:50.720 --> 12:51.920
Yours is okay as well.

12:52.480 --> 12:54.080
Today, these orchid knots

12:54.080 --> 12:55.840
are meant to be given to the one you love,

12:55.840 --> 12:57.170
in exchange for a peony.

12:57.720 --> 13:00.000
Mine is for Chunzhi.

13:00.360 --> 13:01.360
What do you think?

13:01.720 --> 13:02.450
It's pretty.

13:20.120 --> 13:20.780
That's her.

13:21.120 --> 13:22.390
Look, that's her.

13:22.390 --> 13:23.320
She's our Fourth Lady.

13:23.320 --> 13:23.790
That's her.

13:23.790 --> 13:25.990
She still has the nerve to show her face?

13:28.630 --> 13:29.270
Madam Hu.

13:30.440 --> 13:31.540
I heard

13:31.570 --> 13:34.170
some rumors about your Fourth Lady
last night.

13:34.480 --> 13:35.790
Why didn't your family

13:35.840 --> 13:37.640
set the record straight sooner?

13:39.610 --> 13:41.820
As the Head Madam,

13:42.150 --> 13:44.210
I failed to discipline her properly.

13:51.480 --> 13:53.680
So this is the Xie family's Fourth Lady.

13:53.910 --> 13:55.310
She's indeed beautiful.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.240
Yes.

13:58.150 --> 13:59.010
Fourth Sister.

13:59.440 --> 14:00.750
Why are you so late?

14:01.120 --> 14:03.550
Don't tell me you didn't sleep well
after spending the night

14:03.550 --> 14:04.950
at Lord Yan's residence.

14:07.670 --> 14:09.270
"Orchids lush and fragrant,

14:09.510 --> 14:11.240
their fragrance rising high."

14:11.270 --> 14:14.510
I got held up by some family matters.

14:15.670 --> 14:16.790
I can brush off idle gossip

14:16.790 --> 14:18.390
from outsiders with a laugh,

14:18.550 --> 14:20.000
but if even my own sisters

14:20.200 --> 14:22.030
spread slander without a second thought,

14:22.030 --> 14:24.630
don't you think
you're disgracing yourselves as well?

14:24.630 --> 14:26.960
And worse, of ruining the reputation of
our Xie family's daughters?

14:26.960 --> 14:27.440
You...

14:27.510 --> 14:28.000
Today,

14:28.120 --> 14:29.910
I'll teach you a proper lesson
on behalf of the Xie family!

14:29.910 --> 14:30.970
What are you doing?

14:33.150 --> 14:35.000
Daughters of a prominent family,

14:35.000 --> 14:37.150
slandering someone's good name
with nothing but empty words—

14:37.150 --> 14:39.410
and she's your own blood sister, no less.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.450
-Lady Prefect.
-Lady Prefect.

14:43.790 --> 14:46.720
Lord Yan sent Fourth Lady
to my residence yesterday.

14:47.270 --> 14:50.600
If spending a single night there
means her virtue is ruined,

14:50.670 --> 14:52.360
then what does that make
our Prefect's Residence?

14:52.360 --> 14:54.440
Some filthy den of vice?

14:55.320 --> 14:56.720
Please calm down, Your Ladyship.

14:56.720 --> 14:57.600
My sisters are young

14:57.600 --> 14:58.840
and spoke without thinking.

14:58.840 --> 15:00.030
They overstepped their bounds.

15:00.030 --> 15:01.630
I hope you will forgive them.

15:07.330 --> 15:09.930
[Heir to the Founding Count, Pei Guanling,
courtesy name Lanshan]

15:10.320 --> 15:11.030
Ladies.

15:11.320 --> 15:13.000
The Chuiwan match is about to begin.

15:13.000 --> 15:13.800
Lady Prefect.

15:14.240 --> 15:15.450
I've heard that back in the day,
you could hit

15:15.450 --> 15:16.480
9 out of 10 shots.

15:16.600 --> 15:17.240
Could you treat us

15:17.240 --> 15:18.700
to a demonstration today?

15:19.790 --> 15:21.230
Oh, don't be silly.

15:21.390 --> 15:22.080
Today

15:22.240 --> 15:24.100
is for you young folks to have fun.

15:24.200 --> 15:25.630
What business does
an old woman like me have

15:25.630 --> 15:26.910
getting involved?

15:27.150 --> 15:29.630
Still, it wouldn't be the same
without you

15:29.790 --> 15:31.120
presiding as the judge.

15:38.320 --> 15:39.440
It's Chunzhi!

15:39.720 --> 15:40.770
Second Sister, wait for me.

15:40.770 --> 15:42.000
Chunzhi!

15:45.390 --> 15:46.120
Qingyuan,

15:46.440 --> 15:47.200
come with me.

15:47.750 --> 15:48.270
Yes.

16:01.080 --> 16:01.670
Qinghe.

16:09.720 --> 16:10.850
Your handkerchief.

16:33.910 --> 16:35.770
Magnolias suit you beautifully.

16:52.150 --> 16:53.440
Chunzhi!

16:52.630 --> 16:54.870
[Heir to the Marquis of Danyang,
Li Congxin, courtesy name Chunzhi]

17:00.840 --> 17:02.120
Chunzhi!

17:07.270 --> 17:08.680
Chunzhi!

17:15.030 --> 17:16.030
Chunzhi!

17:16.109 --> 17:17.550
Chunzhi!

17:26.440 --> 17:27.720
Chunzhi!

17:31.160 --> 17:33.960
That was so accurate! Amazing!

17:35.030 --> 17:35.790
Chunzhi.

17:38.960 --> 17:40.350
Chunzhi!

17:53.720 --> 17:55.110
Chunzhi!

17:57.350 --> 17:59.960
Chunzhi, are you tired?

18:03.640 --> 18:05.320
Who said I wanted to marry Congxin?

18:05.320 --> 18:07.320
[Li Congxin] [Xie Qingru]

18:05.640 --> 18:06.750
Then why did you write his name

18:06.750 --> 18:08.110
on your red ribbon?

18:08.400 --> 18:09.400
That's because

18:09.750 --> 18:11.610
he's the one I care about the most.

18:13.550 --> 18:14.680
So it's him.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.510
Li Congxin.

18:17.440 --> 18:18.640
Chunzhi!

18:27.790 --> 18:29.650
Why is Lord Yan still not here yet?

18:29.920 --> 18:31.390
You haven't heard?

18:31.750 --> 18:34.710
Lord Yan had a lady
keeping him company last night.

18:34.790 --> 18:37.250
He's probably forgotten all about us
by now.

18:38.830 --> 18:40.970
As they say, youth must have its fling.

18:41.480 --> 18:41.880
Miss.

18:43.720 --> 18:44.310
Miss.

18:45.200 --> 18:46.730
Miss, please wait a moment.

18:46.920 --> 18:47.920
You must be

18:48.160 --> 18:51.290
the Fourth Sister the Xie family
recently brought back.

18:52.750 --> 18:54.880
Is that the girl you're talking about?

18:55.270 --> 18:56.000
Fourth Lady?

18:57.030 --> 18:58.960
I've heard quite a lot about you lately.

18:58.960 --> 18:59.560
Is that so?

19:00.160 --> 19:02.220
Then do you believe it, Young Master?

19:04.880 --> 19:05.480
Look.

19:05.880 --> 19:08.010
Now that you're standing here with me,

19:08.480 --> 19:09.400
it won't be long

19:09.720 --> 19:10.850
before these rumors

19:10.920 --> 19:12.480
spread all over Hengtang.

19:13.030 --> 19:15.920
This Fourth Lady of the Xie family
is really something.

19:15.920 --> 19:18.110
Last night she was all over Lord Yan,

19:18.400 --> 19:19.460
and look at her now—

19:19.510 --> 19:22.240
already chatting with
Marquis of Danyang's son.

19:25.350 --> 19:26.030
Is that so?

19:27.640 --> 19:28.400
I don't care.

19:32.270 --> 19:34.930
Last night she was still
flirting with Lord Yan,

19:35.590 --> 19:37.590
and today she's already throwing herself
at Young Master Li.

19:37.590 --> 19:38.960
Just like her mother—

19:39.310 --> 19:41.840
always resorting to
those seductive tricks.

19:41.920 --> 19:44.070
Young Master, you made such a sharp turn
and reined in your horse just now.

19:44.070 --> 19:45.240
Quite the display of gallantry,

19:45.240 --> 19:46.550
basking in everyone's admiration

19:46.550 --> 19:48.110
and indulging yourself in the moment.

19:48.110 --> 19:50.110
But have you ever considered

19:50.480 --> 19:53.280
that you could cause the horse
irreversible harm?

19:55.750 --> 19:57.590
I can't help but wonder,

19:58.070 --> 20:00.680
do you truly love horses, Young Master?

20:05.070 --> 20:06.790
Lord Yan has arrived!

20:12.350 --> 20:12.960
Lord Yan.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.680
Greetings, Lord Yan.

20:14.680 --> 20:15.880
Greetings, Lord Yan.

20:19.880 --> 20:21.270
This Fourth Lady of the Xie family

20:21.270 --> 20:23.030
certainly seems to be quite popular.

20:23.030 --> 20:26.030
Even the Heir to the Marquis of Danyang
seems to have taken a liking to her.

20:26.030 --> 20:26.790
That young man

20:26.790 --> 20:27.960
is the Marquis of Danyang's only son,

20:27.960 --> 20:29.070
and he's always been
something of a womanizer.

20:29.070 --> 20:30.160
Nothing like you, Lord Yan—

20:30.160 --> 20:31.030
young, accomplished,

20:31.030 --> 20:32.200
and handsome as ever.

20:32.200 --> 20:33.310
Indeed. Indeed.

20:36.310 --> 20:37.240
Take your seats.

20:37.550 --> 20:39.680
-Lord Yan, please.
-Lord Yan, please.

20:42.880 --> 20:43.830
Chunzhi.

20:43.960 --> 20:44.640
Look.

20:45.030 --> 20:47.360
What do you think of
the orchid knot I made?

20:47.550 --> 20:48.280
Is it pretty?

20:48.960 --> 20:49.690
It's pretty.

20:49.790 --> 20:51.050
So where's your peony?

21:00.790 --> 21:02.160
Ignore her.

21:04.590 --> 21:05.450
Fourth Sister.

21:06.400 --> 21:07.920
Your Lord Yan is here.

21:10.110 --> 21:11.000
Lord Yan,

21:11.160 --> 21:12.590
you came quite late today.

21:12.590 --> 21:15.160
Could it be that you lost track of time

21:15.550 --> 21:17.270
with a beauty in your arms last night?

21:17.270 --> 21:18.750
Well, I suppose I have

21:18.750 --> 21:21.280
that courtesan from Zuixian Tavern
to blame.

21:21.480 --> 21:22.830
You certainly have fine taste, Lord Yan.

21:22.830 --> 21:23.880
-That's right.
-You have great taste.

21:23.880 --> 21:25.280
That courtesan. Indeed.

21:26.400 --> 21:28.160
The Chuiwan match is about to begin.

21:28.160 --> 21:31.560
Could you do us the honor of
checking the lots, Fourth Sister?

21:32.030 --> 21:32.920
Chunzhi...

21:40.710 --> 21:42.350
It's time to draw lots.

21:43.350 --> 21:44.940
Time to draw lots.

21:57.350 --> 21:58.000
Done.

22:03.240 --> 22:04.640
My turn. My turn.

22:04.660 --> 22:05.920
My turn. My turn.

22:05.940 --> 22:07.030
My turn. My turn.

22:15.750 --> 22:16.930
-Aren't you participating?
-Mine's blank, too.

22:16.930 --> 22:17.720
What a bummer.

22:17.720 --> 22:18.830
-Let's go.
-What a bummer.

22:18.830 --> 22:19.700
-What a bore.
-Let's go.

22:19.700 --> 22:21.200
Why is mine blank, too?

22:21.250 --> 22:22.760
Let's go.

23:00.550 --> 23:01.070
Coming.

23:01.480 --> 23:02.270
Hurry up.

23:03.960 --> 23:04.790
Little fox—

23:05.310 --> 23:07.170
got so many tricks up her sleeves.

23:08.640 --> 23:09.570
My turn. My turn.

23:11.920 --> 23:13.400
Why are they all blank?

23:14.030 --> 23:15.030
Let's go. Come on.

23:20.350 --> 23:21.240
Chunzhi,

23:21.750 --> 23:23.010
we're on the same team.

23:24.960 --> 23:25.400
Okay.

23:28.720 --> 23:30.380
You two drew the same team too?

23:31.030 --> 23:32.960
Then let's see who comes out on top.

23:34.000 --> 23:37.260
Lord Yan, it seems
you hold this Fourth Lady in high regard.

23:37.590 --> 23:38.200
Why,

23:38.720 --> 23:39.830
Magistrate Guo?

23:40.030 --> 23:41.590
Do you know my mind so well?

23:42.920 --> 23:43.920
I wouldn't dare.

23:44.790 --> 23:45.920
I've heard that

23:46.350 --> 23:48.150
the Founding Countess promised

23:48.240 --> 23:50.960
as long as Young Master Pei
wins this Chuiwan match,

23:50.960 --> 23:53.440
he can marry the woman he loves.

23:54.270 --> 23:55.510
I wonder if

23:55.510 --> 23:57.270
he'll get what he wants today.

23:59.550 --> 24:01.150
So that's what this is about.

24:05.440 --> 24:07.030
The match begins!

24:07.270 --> 24:09.170
[Team Red] [Team Blue]

24:16.680 --> 24:17.210
Chunzhi.

24:17.240 --> 24:17.790
Please.

24:18.680 --> 24:19.200
Let's.

24:19.660 --> 24:21.900
[Team Red] [Team Blue]

24:20.440 --> 24:21.070
Chunzhi,

24:21.310 --> 24:22.040
you can do it.

24:24.210 --> 24:24.860
[Team Red] [Team Blue]

24:30.110 --> 24:31.770
-Team Red scores!
-Nice shot!

24:32.070 --> 24:32.830
Nice shot!

24:36.860 --> 24:38.200
[Team Red: 1] [Team Blue: 0]

24:39.400 --> 24:39.920
My turn.

24:46.720 --> 24:48.830
Nice shot!

24:49.000 --> 24:50.200
Team Blue scores!

24:50.710 --> 24:52.520
[Team Red: 1] [Team Blue: 1]

24:54.350 --> 24:55.410
This is really fun.

25:00.750 --> 25:01.590
Qingru,

25:01.590 --> 25:02.480
go get it!

25:04.590 --> 25:05.440
Chunzhi,

25:05.680 --> 25:06.920
I'm a little nervous.

25:07.070 --> 25:07.680
It's okay.

25:07.680 --> 25:08.680
Don't be nervous.

25:38.680 --> 25:40.080
This is so embarrassing.

25:41.270 --> 25:43.030
Chunzhi, I'm not playing anymore.

25:43.030 --> 25:43.590
It's okay.

25:43.590 --> 25:44.350
How about this?

25:44.350 --> 25:45.200
You watch me play,

25:45.200 --> 25:46.260
and I'll teach you.

25:47.440 --> 25:48.350
Okay then.

25:51.720 --> 25:52.200
Come on.

25:52.790 --> 25:54.190
I'm not very good at this.

25:54.400 --> 25:55.030
It's okay.

25:55.240 --> 25:56.100
I'll teach you.

26:11.480 --> 26:12.880
First, hold it like this.

26:13.000 --> 26:13.920
Swing it out.

26:14.750 --> 26:16.010
Then twist your waist.

26:16.680 --> 26:17.480
Give it a push.

26:17.880 --> 26:18.680
And that's it.

26:19.750 --> 26:20.310
Got it?

26:21.200 --> 26:21.930
Give it a try.

26:35.550 --> 26:37.120
Well done!

26:37.140 --> 26:38.400
Team Blue scores!

26:38.790 --> 26:39.550
How nice.

26:46.100 --> 26:47.420
[Team Red: 1] [Team Blue: 2]

26:50.550 --> 26:51.010
Qingru,

26:51.310 --> 26:52.270
watch me.

26:52.720 --> 26:54.350
See how I beat him.

26:54.960 --> 26:55.690
You can do it.

26:56.720 --> 26:57.520
Here it comes.

27:05.640 --> 27:06.070
Go!

27:08.590 --> 27:09.920
Chunzhi, you're amazing!

27:09.920 --> 27:11.200
Team Red scores!

27:16.660 --> 27:18.320
[Team Red: 2] [Team Blue: 2]

27:43.160 --> 27:44.960
I'm feeling unwell.

27:45.590 --> 27:47.190
If you win the Chuiwan match,

27:47.790 --> 27:50.550
you can decide
who you want to marry yourself.

27:52.640 --> 27:53.400
Are you okay?

27:54.400 --> 27:55.960
I'm fine. Let's do it.

28:22.920 --> 28:24.240
Then for the last ball,

28:24.440 --> 28:25.770
you go ahead and tee off.

28:28.350 --> 28:29.080
Come on then.

28:59.440 --> 29:00.270
Tie!

29:00.720 --> 29:01.960
Halftime break!

29:03.920 --> 29:04.640
It's okay.

29:04.790 --> 29:06.450
There's still the next round.

29:15.110 --> 29:15.880
Chunzhi,

29:16.310 --> 29:17.710
show me how to play again.

29:18.030 --> 29:19.110
Alright, then...

29:19.590 --> 29:21.050
Come here, I'll teach you.

29:22.880 --> 29:23.640
Raise it

29:25.680 --> 29:26.920
and swing forward.

29:29.830 --> 29:30.510
Lanshan,

29:30.510 --> 29:31.480
are you okay?

29:31.880 --> 29:32.510
I'm fine.

29:34.550 --> 29:35.310
Is he okay?

29:35.590 --> 29:36.590
He said he's fine.

29:37.720 --> 29:38.580
Eldest Sister.

29:43.880 --> 29:44.740
Fourth Sister.

29:44.920 --> 29:45.850
What should I do?

29:46.590 --> 29:48.050
I don't think I can do this.

29:48.440 --> 29:49.680
Madam Pei left again.

29:50.240 --> 29:51.100
Eldest Sister.

29:52.350 --> 29:53.400
Be patient.

29:55.070 --> 29:56.310
Looking at the way things stand,

29:56.310 --> 29:57.830
I'm afraid that even if Young Master Pei

29:57.830 --> 29:59.030
is clever and resourceful,

29:59.030 --> 30:00.830
it may still be hard for him
to turn the game around.

30:00.830 --> 30:01.480
Someone!

30:01.920 --> 30:03.270
I bet 50 taels

30:03.350 --> 30:04.750
on Young Master Li to win.

30:05.030 --> 30:06.920
His Lordship the Prefectural Judge
bets 50 taels

30:06.920 --> 30:08.920
on Young Master Li to win!

30:09.640 --> 30:11.070
What if Young Master Pei

30:11.070 --> 30:12.800
has someone lending him a hand?

30:13.270 --> 30:14.730
I can't do anything right.

30:15.310 --> 30:17.710
I don't have the right
to choose my own path.

30:22.750 --> 30:23.610
Eldest Sister.

30:25.750 --> 30:26.610
Do you trust me?

30:31.030 --> 30:32.000
Lord Yan,

30:32.200 --> 30:34.930
are you saying you want to
bet on Young Master Pei?

30:37.030 --> 30:37.680
Come here.

30:38.720 --> 30:39.510
Lord Yan

30:39.510 --> 30:41.240
places a hefty bet of 500 taels

30:41.310 --> 30:42.770
on Young Master Pei to win.

30:42.880 --> 30:43.680
Lord Yan

30:43.680 --> 30:45.350
places a hefty bet of 500 taels

30:45.350 --> 30:47.160
on Young Master Pei to win!

30:50.880 --> 30:52.790
Lord Yan, you're truly generous.

30:56.310 --> 30:56.790
That's right.

30:56.790 --> 30:59.510
The higher you raise it,
the farther the ball will fly.

30:59.510 --> 31:00.750
Yes, just like this.

31:04.160 --> 31:05.030
Not bad.

31:18.550 --> 31:19.880
Alright, watch me play.

31:20.400 --> 31:21.660
Just push it like this.

31:24.920 --> 31:26.520
The weather is so nice today.

31:27.110 --> 31:28.440
What were you chatting about

31:28.440 --> 31:30.440
with Young Master Li just now, lady?

31:31.720 --> 31:33.780
I believe it's none of your business.

31:38.680 --> 31:39.720
Let's get ready.

31:41.240 --> 31:42.880
The second half begins!

32:05.270 --> 32:06.680
Nice shot!

32:06.680 --> 32:08.240
Team Red scores!

32:08.400 --> 32:09.750
Nice shot! Brilliant!

32:09.750 --> 32:11.310
You are amazing, Chunzhi!

32:21.120 --> 32:25.270
[Team Red: 3] [Team Blue: 2]

32:26.400 --> 32:27.030
My turn.

32:27.270 --> 32:27.790
Come on.

32:54.070 --> 32:55.830
As for Qingrong

32:56.030 --> 32:57.310
and Young Master Pei,

32:58.030 --> 32:59.590
their marriage

32:59.720 --> 33:01.270
is already set in stone.

33:02.200 --> 33:02.960
We

33:03.640 --> 33:06.310
mustn't entertain
any improper hopes either.

33:11.030 --> 33:11.890
Eldest Sister.

33:12.550 --> 33:13.810
Are you really willing

33:14.510 --> 33:16.790
to be a discarded pawn?

33:28.510 --> 33:29.400
Hold on!

33:49.270 --> 33:50.330
We concede defeat.

33:52.590 --> 33:53.590
Why?

33:59.070 --> 34:00.400
Then I will choose

34:02.640 --> 34:03.830
this path myself.

34:16.000 --> 34:16.630
They concede defeat?

34:16.630 --> 34:18.070
They're actually conceding defeat.

34:18.070 --> 34:20.550
Then wouldn't Lord Yan's bet...

34:21.280 --> 34:22.110
500 taels.

34:22.110 --> 34:23.570
What a shame. What a shame.

34:27.590 --> 34:29.989
Your hand's injured.
Why didn't you say so?

34:35.320 --> 34:36.230
Truth be told,

34:36.880 --> 34:38.510
when it comes to young people's affairs,

34:38.510 --> 34:41.310
it's best to let them
do as they please and be happy.

34:47.840 --> 34:48.400
Pei,

34:48.630 --> 34:49.590
it's just a game.

34:49.670 --> 34:50.960
Why play while injured?

34:50.960 --> 34:51.760
It's nothing.

34:51.920 --> 34:52.850
Let's continue.

34:56.230 --> 34:58.090
Girls really are more attentive.

34:58.320 --> 34:58.960
You,

34:59.230 --> 35:01.490
on the other hand, just love to act tough.

35:02.550 --> 35:04.010
Please forgive me, Madam.

35:04.480 --> 35:07.280
It's my fault that Young Master Pei
lost the match.

35:09.550 --> 35:10.320
Eldest Lady,

35:10.590 --> 35:13.070
may I have a look at your orchid knot?

35:26.000 --> 35:26.800
Eldest Lady.

35:30.330 --> 35:37.160
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

35:37.180 --> 35:43.660
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

35:43.550 --> 35:44.590
As for your mother,

35:43.760 --> 35:51.400
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

35:44.590 --> 35:46.120
I'll figure something out.

35:46.710 --> 35:47.710
Thank you, Madam.

35:51.520 --> 35:58.820
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

35:58.960 --> 36:05.890
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

36:05.980 --> 36:15.660
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

36:16.880 --> 36:23.890
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

36:23.920 --> 36:30.920
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

36:24.630 --> 36:25.550
From the way

36:25.710 --> 36:27.170
he swung the club just now,

36:27.480 --> 36:30.140
I could tell he has an old injury
in his right arm.

36:30.920 --> 36:32.000
If you trust me,

36:30.950 --> 36:34.440
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

36:32.190 --> 36:33.230
concede the next round

36:33.230 --> 36:34.150
voluntarily.

36:34.470 --> 36:38.130
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

36:34.800 --> 36:35.730
How can I do that?

36:35.960 --> 36:37.760
Young Master Pei has always been
fiercely competitive.

36:37.760 --> 36:38.840
He'd never agree to concede.

36:38.160 --> 36:44.190
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

36:42.400 --> 36:43.280
If you trust me,

36:43.480 --> 36:44.880
I'd never lead you astray.

36:44.880 --> 36:45.940
In this next round,

36:45.960 --> 36:47.760
the only way to win is to concede.

37:05.630 --> 37:08.360
Today's match was truly
full of twists and turns.

37:08.400 --> 37:10.110
What a clever scheme, Fourth Lady.

37:10.110 --> 37:11.360
I don't feel wronged at all

37:11.360 --> 37:12.890
for losing these 500 taels.

37:14.550 --> 37:16.880
Lord Yan, you're making a fortune
every day here in Hengtang.

37:16.880 --> 37:19.150
What's a mere 500 taels to you?

37:22.760 --> 37:23.510
Alright.

37:23.800 --> 37:26.400
Then I'll have to trouble you,
Eldest Lady Xie,

37:26.510 --> 37:27.630
to take our Lanshan

37:27.840 --> 37:29.360
to see a doctor.

37:30.190 --> 37:31.710
His mother often tells me

37:31.880 --> 37:34.070
that when he was little,
he was terrified of needles.

37:34.070 --> 37:35.190
Whenever he had to get a shot,

37:35.190 --> 37:37.550
he'd be as scared as a mouse.

37:38.150 --> 37:39.800
Keep an eye on him for me

37:39.800 --> 37:41.730
and don't let him wriggle out of it.

37:42.510 --> 37:43.630
Yes, Madam.

37:46.520 --> 37:53.290
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

37:50.480 --> 37:51.080
Everyone.

37:52.510 --> 37:54.030
Now that the Chuiwan match is over,

37:53.440 --> 38:00.780
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

37:54.280 --> 37:56.080
young ladies and young masters,

37:56.110 --> 37:58.550
you may now give the orchid knots
and peonies in your hands

37:58.550 --> 38:00.760
to the ones

38:00.760 --> 38:02.110
you love.

38:00.960 --> 38:03.920
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

38:04.060 --> 38:07.390
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

38:07.620 --> 38:14.110
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

38:18.710 --> 38:25.800
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

38:26.150 --> 38:32.550
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

38:32.150 --> 38:33.280
How about

38:32.580 --> 38:36.030
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

38:33.590 --> 38:35.250
giving your orchid knot to me?

38:36.050 --> 38:39.820
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

38:38.960 --> 38:39.840
Lord Yan.

38:39.970 --> 38:46.210
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

38:40.630 --> 38:41.510
You mean this?

38:44.800 --> 38:45.630
Sorry,

38:45.920 --> 38:47.550
I can't give it to you.

39:01.920 --> 39:02.780
Fourth Sister!

39:03.960 --> 39:04.820
Fourth Sister.

39:05.550 --> 39:06.410
Fourth Sister.

39:07.800 --> 39:09.730
Can you give your orchid knot to me?

39:10.840 --> 39:11.710
Well...

39:12.190 --> 39:13.590
What are you looking for?

39:26.840 --> 39:28.840
When did he steal my orchid knot?

39:37.480 --> 39:38.340
Fourth Sister.

39:38.800 --> 39:39.510
For you.

39:41.840 --> 39:42.800
Chunzhi,

39:43.000 --> 39:44.670
how could you give your peony to her?

39:44.670 --> 39:45.840
She was just all over Lord Yan

39:45.840 --> 39:47.030
a moment ago.

39:51.630 --> 39:52.190
Yan Rui!

39:52.510 --> 39:52.910
You...

39:53.110 --> 39:53.510
You...

39:56.960 --> 39:57.590
Yan Rui,

39:57.920 --> 40:00.780
what right do you have
to make decisions for others?

40:00.800 --> 40:01.360
And?

40:02.510 --> 40:03.310
Young Master!

40:03.400 --> 40:04.550
There are so many people here.

40:04.550 --> 40:07.080
Don't let your emotions
get the better of you.

40:15.280 --> 40:15.840
Chunzhi,

40:16.190 --> 40:16.720
let's go.

40:18.360 --> 40:19.230
Chunzhi,

40:19.440 --> 40:21.190
we agreed to
go play Madiao cards together.

40:21.190 --> 40:22.190
Come on, let's go.

40:23.320 --> 40:24.180
Fourth Sister.

40:27.480 --> 40:28.740
Are you coming with us?

40:34.880 --> 40:36.480
Thank you, Young Master Pei.

40:36.800 --> 40:37.710
It's getting late.

40:37.710 --> 40:39.710
Your mother must be waiting for you.

40:40.000 --> 40:41.330
Please head home first.

40:42.030 --> 40:43.090
And what about you?

40:43.550 --> 40:45.070
I have important matters
to discuss with Lord Yan.

40:45.070 --> 40:46.930
I'll return once we're finished.

40:48.400 --> 40:49.880
Chunzhi, come on.

40:50.510 --> 40:51.030
Let's go.
